It's been quite a while since I delved into NT backups, but you  could start 
by visiting www.ultrabac.com. They offer a variety of solutions, including 
backups to removable drives, and also offer native Alpha builds.

One thing I used to find handy was to install a minimum version of NT on 
another drive (or even a separate directory on the system disk). When the main 
installation gets toasted, you can boot straight into the minimum installation 
and do your recovery from there.





