The VAX 83x0 never shipped with more than two CPUs because of a live-lock
problem.  While the problem was seen with four CPUs, but never seen with
three CPUs, it was feared that a three CPU systems could have the problem,
so 82x0/83x0 systems were limited to two CPUs.

The Scorpio systems architect was, and is still, embarrassed.
-- 
Cheers, Bob



