  H9548-AA includes three cables (two BC04V-09/17-02048-01, one 17-02152-03, 
  one 12-13756-A8), one penguin (emperor or king) to be placed on the tellie, 
  assorted bulkheads (70-24505-01, 70-26223-01, 70-28083-01), spam, a Q-bus 
  load module (M9060-YA), spam, grant cards (M9047-SA as needed), spam, and
  various and sundry other parts.

