Working on a rather eclectic (pre-existing!) cluster here.  8 nodes,
VMS running from V6.2 VAX through V7.1-2 Alpha on an FDDI ring.  All
nodes have their own independent system disk, with their own install
of UCX (versions from V4.1 eco 8 through V4.2 eco 4)

For some reason, there are two UCX cluster aliases defined, each of 
which cover two nodes.  The other four nodes do not have a defined
alias.  No metrics running, or dynamic DNS.  If you have nodes named
A through H, A & B are covered by one alias, and D and F are covered
