The particular model that you're using will always boot to the IDE disk if
present.
In later models, specifically the Venturis/Celebris FX-2 models, we modified
the
BIOS to select the particular boot device, i.e. if you had both an IDE disk
and a
SCSI disk, you could select to boot from:

1. floppy
2. CD-ROM (on the IDE channel)
3. SCSI disk
4. IDE disk

This is in the BIOS setup under a section called "Boot".

