Monitors don't have drivers. I assume you are asking about using this
monitor on Windows - where they DO have entries in a monitor .INF
file. 

If I recall correctly, the VRC21-HA is a relabelled Mistubishi
DiamondScan, so you might try settings for a Mitsubishi 21" monitor.
The user manual's part number is EK-VRC21-HX .

My experience with this particular model was not positive...


